00:24:45.460 --> 00:24:48.400
about three things which
really we are looking into.

00:24:48.400 --> 00:24:53.110
One is, we do want
to make it really

00:24:53.110 --> 00:24:57.250
simple for both developers
and our partners

00:24:57.250 --> 00:25:00.940
to build applications on Google
platforms, specifically on IoT.

00:25:00.940 --> 00:25:03.520
