quickly jumpstart

00:25:10.780 --> 00:25:15.940
your journey with IoT on the
UI side, on the API side?

00:25:15.940 --> 00:25:17.440
We started with the
managed service,

00:25:17.440 --> 00:25:19.440
we started with the
MQTT, but we want

00:25:19.440 --> 00:25:22.330
to make it even more simpler
so your overall onboarding

00:25:22.330 --> 00:25:25.060
experience can become
really frictionless for you

00:25:25.060 --> 00:25:27.770
to get started with any
device in any sort of hardware

00:25:27.770 --> 00:25:29.180
you want to do.

00:25:29.180 --> 00:25:32.260
So that's one area where we
want to continue investing,

00:25:32.260 --> 00:25:33.340
and we will invest more.

00:25:33.340 --> 00:25:35.650
And you will see
some feature releases

00:25:35.650 --> 00:25:38.560
in subsequent couple of months.

00:25:38.560 --> 00:25:44.660
The second area really
is our partner ecosystem

00:25:44.660 --> 00:25:46.240
is pretty strong.

00:25:46.240 --> 00:25:50.410
We have a good number of
hardware partners around--

00:25:50.410 --> 00:25:53.860
think about Intel, NXP,
Microchip, Marvell, Sierra

00:25:53.860 --> 00:25:54.460
Wireless.

00:25:54.460 --> 00:25:58.180
All these IoT device and
hardware partners have agreed,

00:25:58.180 --> 00:26:02.320
and they've built simple
